the access we went through, was already there. We didn't break in or anything. Security could of arrived at any time. We never vandalised or taken anything. We only took footage of the building. We left the place as we found it. And we never saw anyone else in the building whilst we were there. We were only in it for a short time to explore and record.
Sadly months later, it burned down to the ground  and now the listed old building is no longer there. We were lucky enough to get one last look around it. I remember buying stuff from there decades prior. I would of liked the building to have be renovated and opened up to the public again. Sadly that will never happen.
